 "request": "Set up reverse transcription for 12 RNA samples, 20 ul reactions in a PCR plate: 4 ul of 5x RT buffer, 1 ul of reverse transcriptase, 1 ul of dNTPs, 1 ul of random primers, 8 ul of RNA and 5 ul of water. For each sample also set up a no-RT control with 1 ul of water in place of the enzyme. The enzyme, buffer, dNTPs and primers are in tubes on a cold block; the RNA samples are in a 96-well plate.",
